- `release` — allowed reserved count to go negative; added a guard that raises `ValueError`

**`src/text_utils.py`** (4 bugs):
- `slugify` — didn't lowercase characters; added `.lower()` on alnum chars
- `slugify` — `replace("--", "-")` missed runs of 3+ dashes; replaced with `re.sub(r"-+", "-", ...)`
- `truncate` — suffix wasn't deducted from the truncation length; changed to `text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix`
